def write_transcript(rec, line):
    c1_spikes = [e for e in rec["spike_events"] if e["t_rel_ms"] <= 26.248]
    text = """# Multi-Agent Ouroboros Swarm — Round 57 transcript

Factory: multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm
Run: 2026-09-02-final-heavy
Generator: grok-4.6
Record id: maos-r57-001
Quota Q: 1
Rights: RM-793 research-only (SpaceXAI/xAI SuperGrok Heavy consumer chat)
Plant: invented SIPHONWOLD / Reedfen Paper PM-6 (not TRIAD / Meridian / VANTIS-CADENCE-AEGIS / LYOSHIELD / CINDERWICK / SODASHARD / PUSHERFELL / CREELWOLD / LIXIVQUERN / OSMOLITH / OSMOQUAY / GAUZEFELL)

Two densifying cycles. Verbatim headings in order. Trajectory Builder cycle 2
emits the only JSONL line (also written to batch-r57.jsonl).

